{
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "anchor": "Plan v13 Wave 2b - canonical SMB margins. Gross/operating sourced from existing v1 + web-anchored for 11 previously-missing industries. Net margin newly explicit, derived from operating margin x 0.55-0.72 by asset intensity, floored at 3%. Defense-in-depth: clampMargin() at render layer also enforces floors. R-002: no source-agency names in user-visible text.",
  "convention": "gross_margin = (revenue - COGS) / revenue (decimal 0-1). operating_margin = (gross_profit - operating expenses) / revenue, BEFORE fixed costs + tax. asset_intensity = gross fixed assets / annual revenue (decimal; 0.3 = $0.30 of fixed assets per $1 of revenue). Values are cross-referenced internally from Damodaran NYU industry margins, IRS SOI ratios, RMA Annual Statement Studies. Source citations live in the internal_source field which is NEVER shown to users (R-002).",
  "disclaimer": "Industry-level proxies only. Actual margins vary materially by business model, scale, and geography.",
  "default_fallback": {
